@startuml sequence_jump_today
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Jump to Today

actor User
participant ReviewScrubberComponent as Comp
participant ReviewScrubberController as Ctrl
participant DashboardModeService as Mode
database localStorage as LS

User -> Comp: tap Today button
Comp -> Ctrl: jumpToToday()
Ctrl -> Mode: setSelectedReviewDate(windowEnd)
Mode -> LS: setItem('commitments.selectedReviewDate', today)

@enduml
